}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q12","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"多选题","topics":["近代物理","光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"02e37b86867ee5a71ba09deebc14a99544668a7cc8b9dbb101adc93bd205e94b","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12. 已知氢原子能级如图所示，现有大量处于某高能级的氢原子，向低能级跃迁时只能发出 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"c"},{"type":"text","value":" 三种可见光，分别用这三种可见光照射图甲电路中的光电管阴极 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，均能发生光电效应。已知可见光能量范围约为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1.65 \\mathrm{eV}"},{"type":"text","value":" 到 "},{"type":"math","value":"3.1 \\mathrm{eV}"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间， "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 光的光子能量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1.89 \\mathrm{eV}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6cd34e7e0fa2f2cf955a51edf8956e0506c6dc5faf6f0f1f36dd69d7d84bcc17.png","width":310,"height":324,"width_mm":36.336,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6d0fbe621e081e81fbcf253cd63d4271d74caee1dcce3af4235dc6a76b5506e0.png","width":266,"height":279,"width_mm":31.221,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图乙\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 三种可见光中 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 光光子的动量最小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 当滑片 P 向 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 端移动时，微安表读数减小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 若实验中 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"c"},{"type":"text","value":" 光的遏止电压为 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{c}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\left| U_{b} - U_{c} \\right| = 0.31\\mathrm{V}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 若用同一装置做这三种可见光的双缝干涉实验， "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 光的条纹宽度最窄。"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q13","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e34034745c710cb3a62198b676416f11828d9a514cd7b5c01de378be43a13d22","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图所示为某水池的剖面图，A、B 两区域的水深分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{B}=2.5m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，点 O 位于两部分水面分界线上，M 和 N 是 A、B 两区域水面上的两点，OM=4m，ON=7.5m。t=0 时刻 M 点从平衡位置向下振动，N 点从平衡位置向上振动，形成以 M、N 点为波源的水波（看做是简谐横波），两波源的振动频率均为 1Hz，振幅均为 5cm。当 t=1s 时，O 点开始振动且振动方向向下。已知水波的波速跟水深的关系为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\sqrt{gh}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，式中 h 为水深， "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1d26f58fdb4fcf2110176f3ff5d5b529d822856a20054f5cd21b9e07a9fd6909.png","width":657,"height":246,"width_mm":77.258,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q13-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 区域中水波的波长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"5\\mathrm{m}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 区域A的水深为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{\\mathrm{A}} = 1.5\\mathrm{m}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 2\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，O点的振动方向向上"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. MN连线之间（不包括M、N）共有4个振动加强点"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学","热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"941e1083f7791671e798268a0e636ddb2e4153f673dd10a15c3999e6357da6ce","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题: (I、II、III三题共 14 分)\nI.（5分）利用如图甲的实验装置“探究加速度与物体受力、物体质量的关系”。\n（1）图乙是实验得到纸带的一部分，每相邻两计数点间有四个点未画出。相邻计数点的间距已在图中给出。打点计时器电源频率为 50 Hz，则小车的加速度大小为 （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":" （结果保留 3 位有效数字）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9a566c665d3aceb6a38edbf356a3c9447e44835b40fa4d9ce9f2536eca52077a.png","width":534,"height":304,"width_mm":62.794,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7aedb3593f00322973bcf1d37dbca3c3d06bbe69b1050e90c5bdab218781455c.png","width":647,"height":159,"width_mm":76.024,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9f8dc0df5584fbf5345b7903528c35ac293217a545d2fd696d87a0b1d35ea70b.png","width":346,"height":215,"width_mm":40.569,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b88f33dc9a5d7f587eee4ba28fea19c43aaf4b2c1ddf372fe28f6ff8a273fe1c.png","width":554,"height":419,"width_mm":65.088,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2) 实验得到的理想 "},{"type":"math","value":"a - F"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像应是一条过原点的直线, 但由于实验误差影响, 常出现如图丙所示的①、②、③三种情况。下列说法正确的是 （填空）\nA. 图线①的产生原因是小车的质量太大\nB. 图线②的产生原因是平衡摩擦力时长木板的倾角过大\nC. 图线③的产生原因是小车的质量太小\n（3）实验小组的同学觉得用图甲装置测量加速度较大时系统误差较大，所以大胆创新，选用图丁所示器材进行实验，测量小车质量 M，所用交流电频率为 50 Hz，共 5 个槽码，每个槽码的质量均为 m = 10 g。实验步骤如下：i．安装好实验器材，跨过定滑轮的细线一端连接在小车上，另一端悬挂着 5 个槽码。调整轨道的倾角，用手轻拨小车，直到打点计时器在纸带上打出一系列等间距的点；ii．保持轨道倾角不变，取下 1 个槽码（即细线下端悬挂 4 个槽码），让小车拖着纸带沿轨道下滑，根据纸带上打的点迹测出加速度 a；iii．逐个减少细线下端悬挂的槽码数量，重复步骤 ii；iv．以取下槽码的总个数 n（ "},{"type":"math","value":"1 \\leq n \\leq 5"},{"type":"text","value":" ）的倒数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{n}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为横坐标， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{a}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为纵坐标，在坐标纸上作出 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{a} - \\frac{1}{n}"},{"type":"text","value":" 关系图线。测得 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{a} - \\frac{1}{n}"},{"type":"text","value":" 关系图线的斜率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2.5\\,\\mathrm{s^{2}/m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则小车质量 M = （填空）kg（计算结果保留两位有效数字）。\nII.（7分）某学习小组用水果和两种金属电极做了一个“水果电池”，进行了以下实验：\n（1）按图甲所示电路图，测量水果电池的电动势和内阻。使用的实验器材有：数字式多用电表（其中电压表可视为理想表）、滑动变阻器、电流表、导线、开关等。请根据电路图在如图乙中完成实物连线（填空）；\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ea487fdb0125b59076302d4f646ce1477698faf5a7eb6f39ba106cead76e5c43.png","width":305,"height":254,"width_mm":35.807,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14-row3"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/260be91cdfdccf4ed4208a6a6867100dbc953e6ab374941dd2c6926f0355a08d.png","width":545,"height":322,"width_mm":64.029,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14-row4"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bd7431a9dc553cf55f80ef2a074dbb5c7d1a628c383fba28b1c9795bb0d68a54.png","width":513,"height":627,"width_mm":60.325,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（2）粗测水果电池电动势，某同学将多用电表直接测量，读数如图丙所示，读数为（填空）V。连接好电路后闭合开关，调节滑动变阻器，记录数字电压表和电流表的示数。作出 "},{"type":"math","value":"U - I"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像，如图丁中曲线所示。由图像求得水果电池的电动势 "},{"type":"math","value":"E ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）V，内阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"r ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）k"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"（结果保留两位有效数字）；\n（3）该同学用三个一样的水果电池串联形成一个电池组，能使某发光二极管（LED）正常发光，LED的 "},{"type":"math","value":"I - U"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像如图戊中曲线所示，则LED正常发光时的电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":" （保留两位有效数字）；\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/eb9d6bec47f186318d871ca5d2732921044b4eaf84ab8896fd4a779ef3458bf0.png","width":525,"height":413,"width_mm":67.755,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（丁）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6428a47751be4ead8b6f5586a0dd376d454adb533732f4eb705981d7b04b1821.png","width":510,"height":413,"width_mm":65.892,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（戊）\n(4) 在 (3) 中, LED 正常发光时, 该同学用普通电压表测量二极管两端电压, 发现电压表示数小于 LED 正常发光时的电压且 LED 熄灭, 造成电压减小原因可能是 （填空） 。 A. 电压表分流; B. 电压表内阻过大; C. 电压表量程过大; D. 电压表正负接线柱接反.\nIII.（2分）下列实验现象说法正确的是（填空）\nA. 在温水中滴入一滴墨水，用眼睛直接观察到墨粉小颗粒的无规则运动，间接说明水分子做不停歇的无规则运动；\nB. 油膜法测分子直径实验中，待图像稳定后我们可观察到薄膜干涉彩色条纹；\nC. 油膜法测分子直径实验中，油酸要足够稀释，因为过浓油酸会使得油酸分子聚集，形成颗粒状物质，导致实验测量结果偏大；\nD. 在研究“玻意耳定律”实验中，推拉活塞时，动作要迅速，以减少气体进入或泄漏而造成误差。\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度 g 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14.（14分）I.\n【答案】（1）2.86……（2分）；B……（1分）；（3）0.20……（2分）\n【详解】（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"a = \\frac{\\left[\\left(10.59 + 13.43 + 16.29\\right) - \\left(2.01 + 4.88 + 7.72\\right)\\right] \\times 10^{-2}}{(3 \\times 0.1)^2} \\mathrm{m / s^2} \\approx 2.86 \\mathrm{~m / s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）A．图线①的产生原因是，砝码盘和砝码的总质量增大到一定程度后不再满足砝码盘和砝码的总质量远小于小车质量，是由于小车质量太小造成的，故 A 错误；\nB. 图线②说明"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{F} = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"时小车就有加速度，其产生原因是平衡摩擦力时长木板的倾角过大，故 B 正确；\nC. 图线③说明 F 增大到一定程度小车才开始有加速度，其产生原因是平衡摩擦力时长木板的倾角偏小或未平衡摩擦力，故 C 错误。故选 B。\n（3）[1]对小车和槽码根据牛顿第二定律分别有"},{"type":"math","value":"5mg - T = Ma"},{"type":"math","value":"T - (5 - n) m g = (5 - n) m a"},{"type":"text","value":"两式联立，求得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{a} = \\frac{M + 5m}{mg}\\cdot \\frac{1}{n} -\\frac{1}{g}"},{"type":"text","value":"[2]由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{a}-\\frac{1}{n}"},{"type":"text","value":"的关系式可知，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{a}-\\frac{1}{n}"},{"type":"text","value":"关系图线的斜率："},{"type":"math","value":"k=\\frac{M+5m}{mg}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即M=0.20kg\nII.\n（1）图略…（1分），\n（2）0.95，0.97，0.75…（每空1分，共3分），\n（3）2.0或2.1...（1分），\n(4) A ..... (2 分);\nIII. C... (2 分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q15","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"debbcc12301df8abd451c1d2ea82b3ad43c6d0a718aa4a67ad2edba92b274181","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）某导热性良好的容器，内含一定质量的理想气体，由状态 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 经过状态 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 变为状态 "},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":" 的 "},{"type":"math","value":"V - T"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像，如图所示。已知气体在状态 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 时的压强是 "},{"type":"math","value":"1.5 \\times 10^{5} \\mathrm{~Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其他已知量在图示中标出。\n(1) 求 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":" 大小。\n(2) 请你建立一个坐标系，并在该坐标系中，作出气体由状态 A 经过 B 变为 C 的 p-V 图像，并标出 A、B、C 的坐标值。\n（3）气体由状态 A 经过 B 变为 C 的过程中，假定气体吸收热量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"5.0 \\times 10^{4} J"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求气体 A、C 状态的内能变化量。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3aa951d4bd74f7f9db60a751348896b299ea95585876c576e73d914b44379f2f.png","width":374,"height":269,"width_mm":48.313,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q15-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）\n（1）A至B是等压过程："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_A}{T_A} = \\frac{V_B}{T_B},\\Rightarrow T_A = 200\\mathrm{K}\\dots\\dots"},{"type":"text","value":"①\n……（2分）\n(2)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f4afcf805cde0e4fca60d8d9f435adfcd8c9c24015ee900234b8f0a5b726ffed.png","width":482,"height":329,"width_mm":61.1},{"type":"text","value":"……（3分）\n（3）A 到 C，以气体为研究对象："},{"type":"math","value":"W_{AC} = -S_{AB} = -3.0 \\times 10^{4} J"},{"type":"text","value":".....② .....（1 分）\n由热力学第一定律可知，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q"},{"type":"text","value":"，有题知，"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 5.0 \\times 10^{4} J"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1 分）\n综述可知，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = 2.0 \\times 10^{4} J"},{"type":"text","value":"。即气体内能增加"},{"type":"math","value":"2.0 \\times 10^{4} J"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaos