ue":" 顺时针转动，线框初始静止锁定， "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻解锁如图 3 所示的正方形导线框 abcd，导线框由静止开始转动。（ "},{"type":"math","value":"\\pi=3"},{"type":"text","value":" ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f84597cb507df14d71e7934a11edb1333e3ec507887f5d002806a69bd4ba01c6.png","width":390,"height":285,"width_mm":45.861,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2e64091559f788ddf966f5db2c709f8b66698e4951d5e85e03d8df44d869a0fb.png","width":332,"height":373,"width_mm":38.982,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图 2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e0f8111103558a6295da9113011693074191933c920127a993890e1b0ef515f0.png","width":463,"height":258,"width_mm":54.328,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图3\n（1）判断 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻，线框 "},{"type":"math","value":"abcd"},{"type":"text","value":" 中的电流方向（用字母 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"math","value":"c"},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" 表示）\n（2）求线框稳定转动时的角速度、及线框中电流的有效值。\n（3）系统稳定转动后某时刻磁场停止转动，求 ab 边还能转过的最大路程。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）\n（1）由右手切割定则可知电流方向为"},{"type":"math","value":"a \\rightarrow b \\rightarrow c \\rightarrow d \\rightarrow a."},{"type":"text","value":".....（2 分）\n（2）以ab边为研究对象，当线框稳定转动时，"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{安}}=f"},{"type":"text","value":"即："},{"type":"math","value":"B\\frac{2BL(v_{0}-v)}{R}L=f"},{"type":"text","value":"，其中"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\omega_{0}\\times\\frac{L}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（2分）\n可得："},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{4}{5}v_{0}=0.08m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"则"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega=8rad/s."},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{2BL(v_{0}-v)}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得："},{"type":"math","value":"I=8\\times10^{-3}A"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n根据电流有效值定义可得："},{"type":"math","value":"I_{e}=\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{3}I=\\frac{8\\sqrt{6}}{3}\\times10^{-3}A"},{"type":"text","value":".....（2分）\n（3）把手停止后，线框由于惯性继续转动切割磁感线。由动量定理可得"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\sum(BIL+f)\\Delta t=0-mv"},{"type":"text","value":"即："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\sum(B\\frac{2BLv}{R}L+\\frac{B^{2}L^{2}v}{2R})\\Delta t=0-mv"},{"type":"text","value":".....（2分）"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{5B^{2}L^{2}}{2R}S=0-mv,"},{"type":"text","value":"代入数据可得：S=0.8m .....（1分）\n结合空缺区域磁场，"},{"type":"math","value":"S_{\\text{总}}=S+S_{\\text{空白}}=1.2m"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-xinzhendi-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"54c2511e9630028d2604b70273cf8d8803acf2dfc511d87b4089f6711edd9c1a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）芯片制造中，离子注入是一道重要的工序，如图所示是一部分离子注入工作原理示意图，离子注入过程需要用电场与磁场进行有效控制。初速度不计的带正电离子从离子源S发出经电场加速后，从 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 点以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 沿半径方向射入圆形磁分析器，磁分析器中存在垂直于纸面向外的匀强磁场 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" （大小未知），与长方体离子控制区的截面abcd相切于 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，其中abcd为该控制区中间竖直平面（与圆形磁分析器处于同一竖直平面）。离子从 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 点进入控制区时，由于边缘效应，离子进入控制区的速度方向会有一定波动（速度大小不变），波动范围在以正常射入方向为轴的最大偏角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 的范围内。开始时控制区不加电场或磁场，离子从 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 点离开磁分析器后可匀速穿过控制区，注入水平底面的硅片上。已知离子质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"q"},{"type":"text","value":" ，在圆形磁分析器中运动的时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" ，图中 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 三点连线正好可构成一个等边三角形， "},{"type":"math","value":"bQ"},{"type":"text","value":" 足够长、ad边长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" ，不计离子的重力和离子间的相互作用。 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 角已知，且由于 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 角较小 "},{"type":"math","value":"(\\theta < 10^{\\circ})"},{"type":"text","value":" 离子不会从控制区的四个侧面射出。\n（1）求加速电场的电势差 U 和圆形磁分析器的半径 r;\n（2）若离子注入硅片时，垂直硅片的速度至少达到 "},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 才能有效注入，为使所有离子均能有效注入硅片，现在控制区加上沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"ad"},{"type":"text","value":" 方向的匀强磁场 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 和同样方向的匀强电场（强场大小可调控），则匀强电场的场强大小应满足什么条件？离子有效注入硅片上的面积最大可达多少？\n(3) 若在控制区加上垂直于 abcd 平面向里的匀强磁场其大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" （且 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0} > \\frac{1.5mv_{0}}{qL}"},{"type":"text","value":" ），现加上沿 ad 方向且大小可调控的匀强电场 E，若要使从 Q 进入并沿平面 abcd 运动的离子都不打到硅片上，求可控匀强电场 E 的取值范围。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b8c6eb497946d7cb4cc0d8dbbea99518d843837ffd79f713757d55f48b367f04.png","width":662,"height":413,"width_mm":77.787,"row_group":"gaosan-xinzhendi-2502-q18-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.【参考答案】\n（1）在加速电场有"},{"type":"math","value":"qU=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"U=\\frac{mv_{0}^{2}}{2q}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n在圆形磁分析器中，做圆周运动，运动轨迹如图"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2523cb8e824443daa9b5e2c94890b1a8743c9df76a5e640caab7a005374e3a25.png","width":813,"height":471,"width_mm":103.1},{"type":"text","value":"其周期为"},{"type":"math","value":"T=\\frac{2\\pi R}{v_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"在磁场中运动时间有"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{60^{\\circ}}{360^{\\circ}}T=\\frac{1}{6}T"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n根据几何关系得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan30^{\\circ}=\\frac{r}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}v_{0}t}{\\pi}"},{"type":"text","value":". ……（2分）\n（2）离子注入硅片时，为使所有离子均能有效注入，根据动能定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"qEL \\geq \\frac{1}{2} m[v^{2} + (v_{0} \\sin \\theta)^{2}] - \\frac{1}{2} mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"E \\geq \\frac{m(v^{2} - v_{0}^{2} \\cos^{2} \\theta)}{2qL}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（2 分）\n离子以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}\\sin\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"的速度做匀速圆周运动，"},{"type":"math","value":"qBv_{0}\\sin\\theta=m\\frac{(v_{0}\\sin\\theta)^{2}}{r'}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1分）\n解得离子有效注入硅片上的面积最大可达"},{"type":"math","value":"S = \\pi(2r')^{2} = \\frac{4\\pi m^{2}v_{0}^{2}\\sin^{2}\\theta}{q^{2}B^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"..... (1 分)\n（3）要使离子都不打到硅片上，偏角最大的离子运动到"},{"type":"math","value":"cd"},{"type":"text","value":"边时，速度恰与"},{"type":"math","value":"cd"},{"type":"text","value":"边相切....（1分）\n在平行于 ab 方向运用动量定理："},{"type":"math","value":"qv_{x}B_{0}\\cdot\\Delta t=m\\cdot\\Delta v_{z}"},{"type":"text","value":".....（1 分）\n式中"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}\\Delta t = \\Delta x"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta v_z"},{"type":"text","value":"是沿"},{"type":"math","value":"ab"},{"type":"text","value":"方向分速度变化量，根据求和式"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum qB_0\\cdot \\Delta x = \\sum m\\cdot \\Delta v_z"},{"type":"text","value":"可得："},{"type":"math","value":"qB_{0}L=mv+mv_{0}\\sin\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n该过程电场力做功，根据动能定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"qEL = \\frac{1}{2} mv^2 -\\frac{1}{2} mv_0^2"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）\n联立解得："},{"type":"math","value":"E \\leq \\frac{(qB_{0}L - mv_{0}\\sin\\theta)^{2}}{2mqL} - \\frac{mv_{0}^{2}}{2qL}"},{"type":"text","value":"……（1分）"}]}}]}
